  "description": {
   "en": "The blind Duchess regained her sight—only to witness her fiancé cheating on her that very day. Determined to take revenge on the scumbag and reclaim her family title, she made a bold move at the wedding—swapping grooms and marrying the infamous, devilishly handsome fugitive instead! Thus begins the tale of a Duchess and a wanted man, where marriage comes first and love follows later. (Cr TL: Gourmet Scans)\n\n----\nThe Duke's Daughter Windsor lost her parents in a car accident several years ago, and she herself was left blind. Supported by her fiancé and her younger sister—who is not related to her by blood—she somehow managed to get by day to day.\n\nHowever, after secretly undergoing treatment and regaining her sight, Windsor discovers that the two have betrayed her and are plotting to take over the dukedom.\n\nDriven into a corner, Windsor sets out to ask the person who treated her eyes for help in ruining the wedding ceremony—but she mistakenly approaches the wrong man.\n\nThat man is Theodore, the head of Blark Bank, who is currently being pursued by the police after being falsely accused of a crime by none other than Windsor’s fiancé.\n\nWith their interests aligned, Theodore proposes a contract marriage to Windsor.\n\nHow will the two of them confront and overcome the hardships ahead…?"
  },
